Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Good. I hope some of your puzzle pieces have fallen into place.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.98,0:00:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going through a very great change.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.84,0:00:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a new glow in your eyes,
