Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You asked me to look after your key.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.34,0:00:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I have it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should take it back.
